            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima Boazi yaaza aha irembo, yaashutama; kandi reeba, ogwo ow'obuzaare bwa haihi, ou Boazi yaagambireho, yaija naarabaho. Boazi yaamweta ati: Yeiwe! ndabaho, oshutame aha kakye. Yaakiikama, yaashutama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.1"
            ]
