              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 22:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima Boazi yaagira ati: Eizooba eri oraagurireho ekyo kibanja na Naomi, omanye ku oshemereire kukigura n'ahari Ruusi Omumoabukazi, muka nyakufa, okugaruraho eiziina rya nyakufa omu buhunguzi bwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogwo munyabuzaare bwa haihi yaagarukamu ati: Nyowe tindikubaasa kukicungura, ntakaashisha obuhunguzi bwangye. Okicungure omu mwanya gwangye, ahakuba tindikubaasa kukicungura.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
