        },
        {
          "text": " Aryaba ow'okukugaruramu amagara, kandi ow'okukuriisa omu bukaikuru bwawe; ahabw'okuba mukaamwana waawe, orikukukunda, kandi orikukukirira abaana b'aboojo mushanju, niwe amuzaire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naomi yaakwata omwana, yaamukiikira, yaaba omurezi we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi abakazi bataahi be baamweta eiziina, nibagira bati: Omwana w'omwojo azaariirwe Naomi. Baamweta Obedi; niwe ishe wa Yese, ishe wa Daudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
